              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is Paleovalley Bone Broth Protein third-party tested?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
